mages/thumb/e/ec/Shattered_Condition_Icon.webp/35px-Shattered_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ec/Shattered_Condition_Icon.webp/53px-Shattered_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ec/Shattered_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ec/Shattered_Condition_Icon.webp/35px-Shattered_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"35\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ec/Shattered_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div></td><td class=\"mbox-text\"><div class=\"mbox-text-span\">This article is about content that is <b><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Inaccessible\" title=\"Category:Inaccessible\">inaccessible</a> through normal gameplay</b>. It can still be accessed via in-game exploits or third party tools.</div></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"> \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-uncommon\"><figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Featherlight_Boots_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d6/Featherlight_Boots_Icon.png/300px-Featherlight_Boots_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/d/d6/Featherlight_Boots_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Featherlight Boots image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d6/Featherlight_Boots_Icon.png/300px-Featherlight_Boots_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d6/Featherlight_Boots_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p>The <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\"><span style=\"color: #01BD39 ;\">Featherlight Boots</span></a> are an uncommon pair of <a href=\"/wiki/Boots\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Boots\">Boots</a> that grants the wearer additional speed while greatly injured.\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>The soft and supple leather glides over your skin. Wearing them feels like running barefoot.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\" style=\"margin-left: 7px\"> \n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Boots\" title=\"Boots\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e5/Boots_Icon.png/25px-Boots_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e5/Boots_Icon.png/38px-Boots_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e5/Boots_Icon.png/50px-Boots_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Boots\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e5/Boots_Icon.png/25px-Boots_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e5/Boots_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Boots\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Boots\">Boots</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/38px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Rarity: Uncommon\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Rarity: <span style=\"color: #01BD39 ;\">Uncommon</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/38px-Weight_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Weight: 0.55 kg (1.1 lb)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 0.55 kg (1.1 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 70 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  70  gp</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">MAG_LowHP_IncreaseSpeed_Boots</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_LowHP_IncreaseSpeed_Boots\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_LowHP_IncreaseSpeed_Boots\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">e3ab8ed8-de3a-466a-ad85-319bdea94bde</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:e3ab8ed8-de3a-466a-ad85-319bdea94bde\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:e3ab8ed8-de3a-466a-ad85-319bdea94bde\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div> \n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Special\">Special</span></h3>\n<p>The wearer of this item gains:\n\n</p>\n<dl><dt><a href=\"/wiki/Burst_of_Speed\" title=\"Burst of Speed\">Burst of Speed</a></dt><dd>When the wearer has 50% <a href=\"/wiki/Hit_Points\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Hit Points\">Hit Points</a> or less, their <a href=\"/wiki/Movement_Speed\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Movement Speed\">Movement Speed</a> is increased by 3 m (10 ft).</dd></dl>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>     \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>This item was only obtainable in Early Access. It was rewarded by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Glut\" title=\"Glut\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Portrait_Glut.png/25px-Portrait_Glut.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fe/Portrait_Glut.png/38px-Portrait_Glut.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fe/Portrait_Glut.png/50px-Portrait_Glut.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Sovereign Glut\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Portrait_Glut.png/25px-Portrait_Glut.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Portrait_Glut.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Glut\" title=\"Glut\">Sovereign Glut</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/Myconid_Colony\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Myconid Colony\">Myconid Colony</a> after helping it kill <a href=\"/wiki/Spaw\" title=\"Spaw\">Sovereign Spaw</a> during <a href=\"/wiki/Avenge_Glut%27s_Circle\" title=\"Avenge Glut's Circle\">Avenge Glut's Circle</a>. This reward was changed to <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Winter%27s_Clutches\" title=\"Winter's Clutches\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9b/Gloves_Leather_F_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Gloves_Leather_F_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9b/Gloves_Leather_F_Unfaded_Icon.png/38px-Gloves_Leather_F_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/9b/Gloves_Leather_F_Unfaded_Icon.png/50px-Gloves_Leather_F_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9b/Gloves_Leather_F_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Gloves_Leather_F_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9b/Gloves_Leather_F_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Winter%27s_Clutches\" title=\"Winter's Clutches\">Winter's Clutches</a> in the full release of the game.</li></ul>\n\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202927\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.097 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.107 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2035/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 27069/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 5384/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1603/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.040/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1495087/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   95.280      1 -total\n 62.43%   59.486      1 Template:EquipmentPage\n 37.50%   35.732      1 Template:Inaccessible\n 36.91%   35.164      1 Template:Inaccessible/internal\n 35.84%   34.146      1 Template:Ambox\n 10.04%    9.566      2 Template:Uid\n  8.86%    8.442      2 Template:Hidden_code\n  8.70%    8.286      5 Template:Icon_text\n  8.47%    8.069      1 Template:PageSeo\n  8.12%    7.733     21 Template:Trim\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:3589-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714202927 and revision id 287251. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}